# Access policy of the methods of interface.midl (MIKSPEC-0023.R47).
# Served by the USB host driver only to the driver of the interface.

Interface.GetInfo: public
Interface.GetConfigurationDescriptor: public
Interface.ControlTransfer: public
Interface.InterruptTransfer: public
Interface.BulkTransfer: public
Interface.SetAlternateSetting: public
Interface.ClearHalt: public
